  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening the Capacity of National Partners in Ireland and Raising Awareness on Trafficking in Persons</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to contribute to strengthening the effective response to and prevention of human trafficking, across key sectors and public bodies in Ireland through capacity building and to contribute to increased awareness among the general population in Ireland on trafficking in persons.</narrative>
  </description>
